given-names></name><name><surname>Bal</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Destexhe</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>A method to estimate synaptic conductances from membrane potential fluctuations.</article-title><source>J Neurophysiol</source><volume>91</volume><fpage>2884</fpage><lpage>2896</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15136605</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p>This work was supported by the National Science Foundation (NSF) Division of Mathematical Sciences, Kavli Institute of Theoretical Physics, and NSF.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>